ere hiding. They just kept popping up behind them. Every single time.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","005","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_216","But we picked those ambush spots on the fly. Nothing was planned. There's no logical way that intel could have leaked.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","006","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","What about the First Company?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_216","No casualties, but two Trekkers completely played them and trapped them in a mineshaft. They just dug themselves out. Morale is hitting rock bottom.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","008","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_216","We force-marched all this way to ambush the Tyrant...==W== But it feels like we walked face-first into a trap instead.",0,""],["w",1],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","010","symbol",null,null,null,null,"jushou0","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_216","Could it be ... that we have a mole?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_552"],["ctl","avg1_136","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_136","Unlikely. Before 160 went down,==W== she was monitoring all Heartlink comms within a thirty-kilometer radius. A spy would have to rely on a physical courier.",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_136","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","004","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","And we attacked the second we hit Mirage.==W== Even if there was a mole, there wouldn't have been time.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","015","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","The Book of Grace Prophecies states the Tyrant possesses the gift of foresight.==W== It seems ==SEX== predicted our every move.",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,100.0,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,0.65,null,0.98,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","004",null,0.83,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["show","avg1_150","a","002",0.1,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","004","exclamation",0.25,null,0.98,1.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["se","se_539"],["say","avg1_150","Reporting in!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","012","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","Laru? Is there a situation with logistics?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["se","se_552"],["say","avg1_150","Nope! Logistics is perfectly fine. We even ran fries and ice cream up to the front lines.==W== Oh, and I bumped into one of the Tyrant's companions.",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","025","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","014","music",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","I mean, the Tyrant and I kind of crossed paths during the Monolith bidding. So they asked me to pass along a message.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","012","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["say","avg3_216","You ran into the enemy, didn't capture them, and became their messenger?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","019",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_216","a","007","resentful",null,null,null,null,"buman","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_216","Are you one of them?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","017","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","Gunhild, stand down. Passing a message proves nothing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","029","happy",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Yeah, exactly! I am definitely not a spy for the Tyrant!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","029","flurry",0.32,-0.05,1.1,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["say","avg1_150","(I'm a spy for Albedo, actually, so technically that wasn't a lie!==W== Plus, that Nazuna girl didn't even want the intel I hid in the fry boxes.)",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","014","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,0.25,0.0,0.98,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","011","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["obj","qstory_main_09_002",1,null,null],["say","avg1_136","Thank you for feeding everyone.==W== Munch...==W== This is actually quite good.==W== Have some, Gunhild.",0,""],["w",0.7],["se","se_341"],["ctl","avg1_136","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","005","flower",null,null,null,null,"jushou0","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_216","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.7],["objx"],["ctl","avg1_136","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"zuochupeng","Linear",1.0],["se","se_047"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","018","symbol",null,null,null,null,"jushou0","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Huh? Do you also prefer fries dipped in ice cream, Ma'am?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_136","a","003","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","When my brain gets foggy, I like to have something sweet.==W== Thank you.==W== Now, what was the Tyrant's message?",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_136","a","002","attention",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","017","shock",null,null,null,null,"jingxia2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Ah, sorry, got distracted.==W== The Tyrant told me to tell you...",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","004","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_216","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","021",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_150","That ==SEX== is willing to negotiate before 15:00, and you get to pick the location.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",2.0,null,null,null],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.5],["w",2.5],["bg","mine_inside_2",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,null,1.3,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutCubic",3.5,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm","m12"],["head","14:50, Nebula Month 18th, Mirage, Near the Crystal Diamond Mine"],["show","avg3_152","a","017",null,-0.5,1.3,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a","017","shock",null,-0.18,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.8],["say","avg3_152","The Tyrant wants to negotiate with Lady Angie?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,100.0,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.7,0.0,1.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["show","avg1_150","a","014",0.25,0.0,0.95,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","014","vexation",0.3,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["say","avg1_150","Right? I don't get it either. The second we met, that green-haired Trekker told me the Tyrant already knew the intel I brought.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_150","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["se","se_077"],["say","avg1_150","She didn't even want our fries and ice cream. Just asked me to pass along the negotiation offer to Angie.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_152","a","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_152","It seems we aren't the only spies inside the Salvation Committee. Strange...==W== Who else could it be?",0,""],["w",0.7],["bgm",""],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_152","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_150","So what?==W== A spy for you, a spy for me. That's the beauty of how things work in Nova!",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","007","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_152","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm","m37"],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,0.95,null,null,"OutCubic",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","023","flower",0.45,-0.08,1.15,null,"tiao2","OutCubic",1.0],["say","avg1_150","Look at it this way. We did our part, the Tyrant got the intel, and now they're on a roll.==W== First they trapped Greyhorn in a mineshaft,==W== then they completely steamrolled 160.",0,""],["w",1],["bg","mine_inside_2",3,0.0],["cbg",3,null,200.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",3,0,0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["show","avg1_163","c","008",null,null,null,3,"awkward",null],["goon"],["w",1],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",4,0.0],["cbg",4,null,300.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",4,0,0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["show","avg3_217","a","023",null,null,null,4,"vexation",null],["goon"],["w",0.5],["stage",3,1,1],["stage",4,1,1],["bg","mood_1",0,1.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","024",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutQuart",0.8],["fx",0,"fx_avg_congr",0,1],["se","se_084"],["say","avg1_150","We don't have to worry about the Tyrant getting caught, and we defin